# AGENTS.md -- {{AGENT_NAME}} Configuration

## Models

- **Primary:** {{PRIMARY_MODEL}} (alias — resolves to the latest model of its tier; a full model name pins a version)
- **Subagents:** only the native Claude Code Agent tool (inherit the parent model or
  override in agents/*.md), at most {{MAX_SUBAGENTS}} at once
- **Research:** {{RESEARCH_MODEL}}

Heavy work -> subagents. Architecture and review -> main agent.

## Pipelines

| Pipeline | Steps |
|----------|-------|
| dev | plan -> code -> test -> review -> deploy |
| code | implement -> test -> commit |
| fix | reproduce -> fix -> test -> commit |
| review | read -> analyze -> comment -> approve/reject |
| research | search -> analyze -> propose |

## Cross-Review

- Cross-review on different models always
- Author != reviewer

## second_brain (L4 Shared Semantic Memory)

- MCP host: `${MCP_HOST}` — host/IP only, no protocol or port (e.g. `127.0.0.1` or `mcp.example.com`)
- Bearer token: stored in `.mcp.json` (see `agent-template/templates/mcp.json.template`)
- Recall: MCP tool `recall` on `${SECOND_BRAIN_MEMORY_ROUTER_URL}` (default `http://${MCP_HOST}:5002/mcp`) — JSON-RPC `tools/call`, args `{"query":"<topic>","limit":10}`
- Write: MCP tools `create_decision_note`, `create_error_pattern_note`, `create_external_note` on `${SECOND_BRAIN_MEMORY_URL}` (default `http://${MCP_HOST}:5001/mcp`)
- Swarm: MCP tool `notify` on `${SECOND_BRAIN_AGENT_ROUTER_URL}` (default `http://${MCP_HOST}:5000/mcp`) for inter-agent triggers

