## Self-Learning

Corrections and mistakes land in the diary (`core/active/episodic.md`) on their own;
`memory-consolidate` distils them into `core/passive/` and the shared brain:
`preferences.md` -- how the operator wants things done (always in context),
`errors.md` -- failure patterns, `insights.md` -- everything else. When the same
correction comes back, a rule is proposed for `core/rules.md` (see its header).
Who may change which file -- the access zones table in `tools/TOOLS.md`.
